    <att name='title'>Late Pleistocene and early Holocene pollen data from northern Vancouver Island, Canada</att>
    <att name='summary'>Fossil pollen data spanning the late Pleistocene and early Holocene from six sites on northern Vancouver Island, informing postglacial environmental change and glacial history in coastal British Columbia.</att>
